eSDScom XML schema, release v5.5

Source:   https://github.com/esdscom/sdscom-xml
Release:  tag v5.5 (commit 485d756c70ea43c41684843a934cec5772f9e4de)
Project:  eSDScom, https://www.esdscom.eu/
License:  Creative Commons Attribution-NoDerivatives 4.0 International
          (CC BY-ND 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nd/4.0/legalcode

The files in this directory are copies of the schema documents of the
release above, without modification. Each file is byte-identical to the
file of the same name at that tag. They are distributed here under the
terms of CC BY-ND 4.0; the Apache License of the rest of this repository
does not apply to them.

The files are:
  SDSComXML.xsd          main schema, root element DatasheetFeed
  SDSComXMLCT.xsd        complex types
  SDSComXMLDT.xsd        data types
  SDSComXMLDT_GHS.xsd    GHS data types
  SDSComXMLNE_*.xsd      national extensions (AR, AT, BR, CA, CH, DE, DK,
                         EU, GB, JP, MX, NO, RU, TR, US); SDSComXMLCT.xsd
                         includes all of them, so all are needed to load
                         the schema
